<section class="about-section relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.08)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 py-16 lg:py-20"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div class="lg:w-1/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6"><div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-users text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><div><div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-eurogold-400">Eurocert Team</div><div class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-white/30">Established 1998</div></div></div><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-5 leading-tight tracking-tight">Who We Are</h2><p class="text-white/60 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Eurocert Asia is affiliated with Eurocert SA, Athens, Greece, which is a leading global independent third-party inspection, audit and certification body.</p><div class="space-y-3 mb-6"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition"><i class="fas fa-check text-eurogold-400 text-[10px]"></i></div><p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-white/90 transition">Social accountability audits (SA 8000, SEDEX/SMETA)</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition"><i class="fas fa-check text-eurogold-400 text-[10px]"></i></div><p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-white/90 transition">Quality and compliance inspections</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition"><i class="fas fa-check text-eurogold-400 text-[10px]"></i></div><p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-white/90 transition">ISO certifications, CE marking, and sustainability certifications</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 group"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-hover:bg-eurogold-400/20 transition"><i class="fas fa-check text-eurogold-400 text-[10px]"></i></div><p class="text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed group-hover:text-white/90 transition">and many more....</p></div></div><div class="mb-6 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-user-tie text-euro-400 text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our auditors are highly qualified professionals with backgrounds in<!-- --> <span class="text-white/80 font-semibold">law, MBA, human resources, and the apparel industry.</span></p></div></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-eurogold-400 border border-eurogold-400/30 rounded-full px-8 py-4 hover:bg-eurogold-400/10 transition-all group" href="/about/">Learn More<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px] transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"></i></a></div><div class="lg:w-1/2"><div class="rounded-3xl overflow- border border-white/10 shadow-[0_0_60px_rgba(212,168,67,0.12)] relative"><video preload="none" class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover" data-autoplay-desktop muted="" loop="" playsInline=""><source src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/video/upload/q_auto,f_mp4,w_720/f_mp4,q_auto:good,w_1280,br_1800k/v1781674378/Image_to_Moving_Emotion_Video_qygqdg.mp4" type="video/mp4"/></vid